{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日電車にのってたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで目的地に着いたから降りようと思ったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで混んでたから勢いよく出ようとしたら\n『ドンッッッ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いったぁーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って正面見たらまだ開いてなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ドアが透明で綺麗だったので見えなかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ恥ずかしかった和田まあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てーここだけクルクルに\nいつもやってもらってるヘアーメイクさんにやられたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざとだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインしよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って\n冗談でメンバーと話してたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら冗談で言ったの知ってるのに、まぁやのとこにきて\nハーフツインやって来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁおかげで皆に写メ撮られてモテモテだったけど......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアーメイクさんもとっても楽しい方なんだ〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして最近\n『ファニーボーン』\nっていう言葉を覚えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでメンバーに何回も自慢したんだけど皆知っててショックだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから\n白石まいちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川まいちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さゆりちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ひなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高山かずみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、まぁや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、最近覚えたて言葉や難しい言葉を話してました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで、まいまいから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ゲシュタルトホウカイ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう言葉を教えてもらったよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかわかる!?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんで今日はろってぃーからスカートもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前は上着くれたし......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと嬉し〜気持ち!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←（ロティー語だよ♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント今回も素敵な言葉をありがとう♪\nまあやってそんなふうに思ってもらえてるんだ〜って思えて、もっともっと皆が笑顔になれるよう頑張ります〜!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではテスト勉強しなきゃなので"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/02/28/2353235/0011.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}